{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2022-08-11 11:10:00', 'title': "M&T BANK SPOTLIGHTS CONNECTICUT SMALL BUSINESSES IN INNOVATIVE POP-UP SHOP CONCEPT AT CAPTAIN'S COVE SEAPORT", 'text': "LOCAL SMALL BUSINESSES WILL HAVE ACCESS TO RETAIL SPACE AT BRIDGEPORT'S\xa0 PREMIER TOURIST DESTINATION\xa0 BRIDGEPORT, CONN. , AUG. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- M&T BANK IS BRINGING ITS INNOVATIVE SPOTLIGHT SHOP CONCEPT TO CONNECTICUT, PROVIDING LOCAL SMALL BUSINESSES WITH AN OPPORTUNITY TO MARKET THEIR UNIQUE PRODUCTS FROM A POP-UP SPACE IN BRIDGEPORT'S POPULAR CAPTAIN'S COVE SEAPORT."}